sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Client App
    participant API as Resource Server API
    participant AS as Authorization Server
    participant JWKS as JWKS Endpoint
    participant Introspect as Introspection Endpoint

    Client->>API: API request<br/>Authorization: Bearer access_token
    API->>API: Extract token from Authorization header
    alt JWT access token
        API->>API: Decode header and payload
        API->>JWKS: Fetch signing keys if needed
        JWKS->>API: Return public keys
        API->>API: Validate signature, iss, aud, exp, nbf,<br/>scope, token type, and trusted key
    else Opaque token
        API->>Introspect: POST token to introspection endpoint
        Introspect->>AS: Check token status and metadata
        AS->>Introspect: Token active/inactive + claims
        Introspect->>API: Introspection response
    end
    alt Token valid and scope is enough
        API->>Client: Return protected resource
    else Token invalid or insufficient
        API->>Client: 401 Unauthorized or 403 Forbidden
    end
